eased animator, immediate swap when not visible) is modeled on Muzei
(https://github.com/muzei/muzei), Copyright Google Inc., licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. No Muzei source code is included in this project.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Immich.

Fork additions (schedule, per-cycle cache, foldable crop, transport hardening) are
Copyright sharkusmanch and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The schedule semantics (ordered date-of-year ranges, first match wins, year wrap,
default fallback) are ported from immich-kiosk-scheduler
(https://github.com/sharkusmanch/immich-kiosk-scheduler), MIT License.
